{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"04647d3e8f44e649b6d73328cb40599132a398e7b6297ea6c2f76790eabfc589","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿宣布以色列受惩罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，不要像外邦人欢喜快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你行邪淫离弃你的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各谷场上如妓女喜爱赏赐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谷场和酒榨都不够以色列人使用；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒也必缺乏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必不得住耶和华的地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲却要归回埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必在亚述吃不洁净的食物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必不得向耶和华奠酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即便奠酒也不蒙悦纳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的祭物必如居丧者的食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡吃的必被玷污；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们的食物只为自己的口腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不奉入耶和华的殿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大会的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到耶和华的节期，你们怎样行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，他们逃避灾难；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人必收殓他们的尸首，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩弗人必葬埋他们的骸骨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们用银子做的美物上必长蒺藜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的帐棚中必生荆棘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"以色列人必知道降罚的日子临近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报应的时候来到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民说：作先知的是愚昧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受灵感的是狂妄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"皆因他们多多作孽，大怀怨恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲曾作我 神守望的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于先知，在他一切的道上作为捕鸟人的网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他 神的家中怀怨恨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲深深地败坏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如在基比亚的日子一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必记念他们的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追讨他们的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的罪及其后果"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"主说：我遇见以色列如葡萄在旷野；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看见你们的列祖如无花果树上春季初熟的果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却来到巴力·毗珥专拜那可羞耻的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就成为可憎恶的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与他们所爱的一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于以法莲人，他们的荣耀必如鸟飞去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不生产，不怀胎，不成孕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"纵然养大儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我却必使他们丧子，甚至不留一个。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我离弃他们，他们就有祸了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看以法莲如泰尔栽于美地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲却要将自己的儿女带出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"交与行杀戮的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，求你加给他们—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"加什么呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使他们胎坠乳干。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华审判以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：他们一切的恶事都在吉甲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在那里憎恶他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们所行的恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必从我地上赶出他们去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再怜爱他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的首领都是悖逆的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲受责罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"根本枯干，必不能结果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即或生产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必杀他们所生的爱子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["先知论以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我的 神必弃绝他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不听从他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也必飘流在列国中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}